Begin Add a New Order Panel
	Open the sidemenu
	Click the "Control Panel" sidemenu entry
	Click the "Orders" charttab
	Click the "Orders-Panels" charttab subtab
	Click the "Add Order Panel" link
	Enter "Electrolytes Flowsheet"  into the "panel_order_ac_txt" autocomplete
	Enter "Sodium" into the "le_order_panel_le_includes_order_id_display" autocomplete
	Click the "Add" button
	Enter "Magnesium" into the "le_order_panel_le_includes_order_id_display" autocomplete
	Click the "Add" button
	Enter "Chloride" into the "le_order_panel_le_includes_order_id_display" autocomplete
	Click the "Add" button
	Click the "Save" button
	Verify exists "Order panel Electrolytes Flowsheet successfully created" text
	Type "Electrolytes Flowsheet" into the "search_text" input
	Click the "Search" button
	Verify exists "Electrolytes Flowsheet" text

Begin Edit the New Order Panel
	Click the "Edit" listview link
	Enter "Phosphorus" into the "le_order_panel_le_includes_order_id_display" autocomplete
	Click the "Add" button
	Click the "Save" button
	Verify exists "Order panel Electrolytes Flowsheet successfully updated" text
	Verify exists "Phosphorus" text

Begin Copy the New Order Panel
	Click the "Copy" listview link
	Enter "Renal Panel"  into the "panel_order_ac_txt" autocomplete
	Click the "Copy" button
	Verify exists "Order panel successfully copied!" text
	Type "Renal Panel" into the "search_text" input
	Click the "Search" button
	Verify exists "Sodium" text
	Verify exists "Magnesium" text
	Verify exists "Chloride" text
	Verify exists "Phosphorus" text

Begin Delete the Copied Order Panel
	Click the "Delete" listview link
	Verify exists "Are you sure you want to delete the order panel (Renal Panel)?" text
	Click the "Yes" Button
	Verify exists "Order panel Renal Panel successfully deleted (emptied)." text

